  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Batch ingestion \u2014 Excel landing files \u2192 Postgres staging (ODS)\nThe **file-watcher** detects each new Excel file in `landing/`, the **ingestion API** registers it and the **Airflow DAG `sdi_01_batch_ingestion`** reads, validates and bulk-loads every sheet. Use the *Refresh* selector to compare the BASE historical load with refresh R1/R2."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Files / sheets loaded",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "sdi-postgres"
      },
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "sdi-postgres"
          },
          "rawSql": "SELECT count(*) FROM ops.batch_load_log WHERE refresh_tag IN (${refresh:sqlstring})",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
